    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati na Ahabu wa Isilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yehoshafati akasaba kīngī nasho, nīyo ūbiza nkūjiwa ntaale no; kwimanīla wanwaana na Ahabu, ūntooja koi ng'witūnja wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya myaka būlebe, ū Yehoshafati ūja ī Samalia kūngeniha ū Ahabu. Ū Ahabu ūsīnza ng'holo na ng'ombe ningī, kūlwa kūntona ū Yehoshafati na a banhū abo walī wageniha nabo; ūnomba na kūja hamò nang'hwe kū būlūgū kwīdumīla Lamosi-gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahabu ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūng'wīla ū ntemi Yehoshafati wa Yuda, “Ūdūgije kūja hamò nane tūkalwe būlūgū nayo ī Lamosi-gileadi?” Ū Yehoshafati ūnshokeja ūhaya, “Ū nene nalī gīt'ūmo ūlī ū bebe, na a banhū bane balī banhū bako, tūkūbiza nang'ho ū mu būlūgū.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bahangi ba ng'wa Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike nang'hwe ū Yehoshafati ūshosha ūhaya, “Alīyo ni yabeelela kūmūja tame ū SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūbakobya a bahangi, biza banhū magana anè; ūbabūūja, “Mulībona kinehe, tūje ī Lamosi-gileadi kwilwisha būlūgū nayo, nūūlū naleke?” Būng'wīla, “Jaga nguno ū Mulungu akūgūtūūla mu nkono gwa ntemi ū nzengo gwenūyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yehoshafati ūbūūja hangī, “A henaha atīho ng'hangibo ng'wa SEEBA ūyo tūdūgije kūbūūja mu nzīla yakwe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūnshokeja gīkī ū Yehoshafati, “Alīho ūmò wasaagaga, lina lyakwe Mikaya ng'witūnja o ng'wa Imula; a hene ni yabeelela ū kūbūūja kūbītīla mulī we, alīyo natantogagwa ū nene ū ng'wenūyo, nguno ndūhū gete atanihangīlaga mihayo ya mhola; akanihangīlaga ya makoye dūhū gwa!” Ū Yehoshafati ūshosha, “Ītī chene baba ntemi, lekaga ū kūhaya gīko!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntemi ūng'witana ūmò wa batūmami bakwe; ūng'wīla, “Ū Mikaya ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Imula ng'wenhage aha ī haha yenīyī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batemi būbīlī wabo benabo, ū wa Isilaeli nū Yehoshafati ū wa Yuda, baalī bazwalīla shizwalo shabo sha nyatemi, hūna bigasha ha masumbī gabo ga nyatemi, ha lūbūūga lwa kūtūlīla, hihī na mita gwa kwingīla mu nzengo gwa Samalia. Pye a bahangi baalī babitinja bakūbahangīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmò wa bahangi, lina lyakwe Zedekia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Kenana, walī wabeeja na mapembe ga chūma; hūna ūyūhaya, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘A genaya ūkūgatūmamīla kūyūbasīsūla gīkī a Baalamu kūshisha baseesagūke.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bahangi a bangī bahangaga mihayo ya mbika yenīyo dūhū; bahayaga, “Īdumīlage ī Lamosi-gileadi ūkūpyena dūhū, nguno ū SEEBA akwītūūla mu nkono gwa ntemi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūyo walī watūng'wa kūnjīla ū Mikaya ūng'wīla, “Bebe pye a bahangī biyo wideebelaga ū būhangi wabo; pye bang'hangīlaga būtindi ū ntemi. Na lūūlū lang'hanaga, nū bebe ūkafunye ū būhangi wako wideebile nū wabo; ūhaye mihayo misoga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Mikaya ūhaya, “Ūmo SEEBA alī mpanga, nakūng'wīla ū ntemi ūyo nalawīlwe na SEEBA dūhū.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhangi bo ng'wa Mikaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayūshika hoi, ū ntemi ūmūja, “Ūlībona kinehe Mikaya, tūje ū kū būlūgū tūkalwe nī Lamosi-gileadi, nūūlū hamo naleke?” Ūshosha alīhaya, “Jaga ūkīdumīle ī Lamosi-gileadi ūkūpyena dūhū, nguno ū SEEBA akwītūūla mu nkono gwa ntemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūng'wīla, “Bebe Mikaya, nakūkwilahīja kūshisha nanalī gīkī yaya ū kūniwīla mhayo gose gose, ūlū ītī kūniwīla ya ng'hana dūhū mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Mikaya ūhaya, “Naababonile a Baisilaeli basambaalile mu ngūlū, gītī ng'holo jitī na ndīīmi; ū SEEBA ūhaya, ‘A banhū benaba batī na ntongeeji ni bajage kaya dūhū; būlī ng'wene akalembeele mu mhola.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūhaya, “Wabona lūūlū, natakūwīlile gīkī ū ng'wenūyū atanihangīlaga mhayo gwawiza ū nene, ūlū ītī makoye dūhū?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Mikaya ongeja kūhaya, “Na lūūlū gūdegelekage ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA: Namonile ū SEEBA igashije h'isumbī lyakwe lya būtemi, na a mabità ga ng'wigūlū gīmīīlile gūmpīndya ū kū būlyo nū kū lūmoso lwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūbūūja gīkī, ‘Nani ūyo adūgije kūnemba lemba ū Ahabu aje akīdumīle ī Lamosi-gileadi akachīle kwenūko?’ Ūmò ūhaya gīkī, na ūngī gīkī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwitūlwa gwiza moyo nebe, gūshika gwīmīīla ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA gūhaya, ‘Nakūja nene nakanemba lembe.’ Ū SEEBA ūbūūja, ‘Mu nzīla kī?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū moyo gwenūyo gūhaya, ‘Nakūja nakabize moyo nomolomo ū mu milomo ya bahangi bakwe pye a bose.’ Ū SEEBA ūhaya, ‘Ū bebe ūkūdūla ū kūnemba lemba, jaga ūkagwīte ū nīmo gwenūyo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, managa gīkī ū SEEBA watūūlile moyo nomolomo ū mu milomo ya bahangi bako benaba pye a bose. Ū SEEBA wakūhelelile ū bebe mihayo mibi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Zedekia ūng'wegeela ū Mikaya ūntūla ipī; hūna ūmūja, “Ū Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA aho wīnga ū kūlī nene, akabītīla nzīla kī hū wiza ū kūlī bebe kūlūngalūnga nang'ho?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mikaya ūshosha, “Ūkūdeeba ū lūshikū lwene ūlīpeela kolobe kolobe kūja mu chūmba sha mu gatī kwibisa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūlagīja, “Ng'wīnjagi ū Mikaya a henaha, munshoshe kūlī Amoni ū nsugi wa mu nzengo, na Yoashi ū ng'witūnja wa ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlagi gīkī, ‘Ūntemi alīhaya: Ū ng'wenūyū ntūūlagi mu jeela, nīyo yaya ū kūng'winha shose shose ūlū ītī minzī na ngatī dūhū, kūshisha nashoke.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mikaya ūhaya, “Ūlū ūlashoke mhola, numho ū SEEBA atayombile kūbītīla mulī nene;” ongeja kūkomeleja alīhaya, “Igwagi banhū bose!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahabu kūbūlagīlwa Lamosi-gileadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntemi wa Isilaeli nū Yehoshafati ū ntemi wa Yuda būja ī Lamosi-gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūng'wīla ū Yehoshafati, “Ū nene nakwingīla ū mu būlūgū nazwalile shizwalo sha kūnīīta natizūmanīka; ū bebe zwalilaga ī shizwalo shako sha nyatemi.” Ng'hana ū ntemi wa Isilaeli wiyīta kūjimīīlīka, hū wingīla ū mu būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū ntemi wa Alamu walī wabalagīja a bataale bakwe ba magogoteni ga būlūgū; ūbawīla, “A bing'we yaya ū kūlwa na munhū ūngī ose ose, abize ntaale nūūlū ndo; ng'wisonjagi ntemi wa Isilaeli dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bataale ba magogoteni aho bamona ū Yehoshafati biwīla, “Ū ng'wenūyū atūduuma kūbiza hū ng'wene ū ntemi wa Isilaeli!” Na lūūlū būngalūkīla, alīyo aho bahaya kwandya kūntūla ū Yehoshafati ūlīla, ū SEEBA ūngunanha; ū Mulungu ūbapamīla kūngī būneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bataale ba magogoteni aho babona gīkī atī ng'wene ū ntemi wa Isilaeli, būleka ū kūnkūūbīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo munhū ūmò kwimanīla wadūta būta wakwe ūlasa isonga kūjīlīīla ū kūlī ntemi wa Isilaeli; lyūbītīla ha būlūngīlo wa shizwalo shakwe sha chūma. Ū ntemi ūng'wīla ū ntongeeji w'igogoteni lyakwe, “Līnyamulage ī ligogoteni ūnīnje ū mu būlūgū nalabūka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būlūgū būūlwa būlwiile kūshisha līīmi tole; ū ntemi walī igashije ng'wigogoteni wishindaalīja ūlolela ū kū Baalamu kūshika mhīndī. Aho lyasalalīja ī līīmi ūcha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
